imately a thousand doors we have  hours and hours of video feed that had  we been able to go to that website  and know that the person at this  specific address had cameras  we could have gone to them quickly on in  the investigation and potentially  gained an investigative lead  so mr jones was arrested in the area of  vegas and rainbow  okay thank you have a good day
 

